      "en": "Now when they had heard all the words, they turned in fear one toward another, and said to Baruch, “We will surely tell the king of all these words.”",
      "ko": "그들이 그 모든 말씀을 듣고 놀라 서로 보며 바룩에게 이르되 우리가 이 모든 말을 왕에게 고하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "c2a6a1a5fe5a3a4a83e327d521047650a3eb80117e59a26596b264601c3700e9",
      "translation_text_hash": "6a4a853909bd9067f9ff0c86096f110f0ffd63ce8e596b00cec7fe15c5412007",
